      "message": "[error] Line 321: 🔴 `setAlias` emits `profileUpdated` synchronously. When `registeredName` is non-empty, the connection installed at lines 148-160 treats any `profileUpdated` for this account as completion of `registerName`, emits `accountAdded`, and disconnects. If the user saves a non-empty alias/avatar after the account\u0027s initial `accountAdded` but before name registration completes, this call can therefore make the wizard switch/finish early; a later failed registration is no longer handled. Wait for `nameRegistrationEnded` for this account and only finalize on a successful status, or otherwise keep profile updates separate from registration completion.",
